{% import 'landing/sections/_shot.html.twig' as shot %}

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ EXCURSIONS ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="excursions">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Excursions</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Book the trip. Change the room.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
            Morale is not a slider you drag. As chairman you book team-building
            excursions — anywhere from a luxury retreat to a community visit — and
            live with what comes back: new bonds, occasionally new grudges, and a
            squad that is measurably different afterwards.
        </p>

        <div class="feature-split is-reversed">
            <figure class="feature-shot">
                {{ shot.img('story-event-chemistry', 'Story event "Instant Chemistry" — a scored goal triggers a bonding moment between two players, each gaining morale, with their link shown on the relationship map', false, 340, '2026-10') }}
                <figcaption>A story event firing mid-match — bonds form, morale moves</figcaption>
            </figure>

            <div class="point-list">
                {% if excursions is not empty %}
                    {# Straight from the live excursion catalogue, so the page cannot
                       advertise a trip that is no longer in the game. #}
                    {% for excursion in excursions %}
                        <div class="point">
                            <span class="point-title">{{ excursion.title }}</span>
                            <p>{{ excursion.body }}</p>
                        </div>
                    {% endfor %}
                {% else %}
                    <div class="point">
                        <span class="point-title">Pick the outing</span>
                        <p>Each excursion has a cost per head, a target audience and a cooldown. A pub quiz is not a warm-weather camp.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="point">
                        <span class="point-title">Read the room after</span>
                        <p>The report maps exactly which pairs bonded and which fell out, and by how much.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="point">
                        <span class="point-title">Nothing is guaranteed</span>
                        <p>Excursions carry a negative frequency. Sometimes the trip is the reason two players stop speaking.</p>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">
